gree angle.&nbsp;</p>



<p>Of course, this is not the only possible method/combination. There are m=
any more. In figure 11, a few other equally useful combinations are shown. =
So, it is obvious that the construction of a 135-degree angle is simple. On=
ly what you need is a grid and one of a combination shown in table 2.</p>



